---
title: MF-04 · Offer, acceptance and start work
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor CL as Client Company User
  participant H as Offer / StartWork handlers
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  actor CA as Candidate
  participant F as PlacementFinanceService
  CL->>H: Create draft and send offer
  alt HEADHUNT_COD and salary not gross monthly
  H-->>CL: 400 HEADHUNT_REQUIRES_GROSS
  else valid
  H->>DB: Offer SENT, Application OFFER_PENDING
  H->>CA: Notify candidate
  end
  CA->>H: Accept offer
  H->>DB: Offer ACCEPTED, Application OFFER_ACCEPTED
  CL->>H: Confirm start work (actual date)
  H->>H: Date not in future and not before acceptance
  H->>DB: Placement STARTED, Application PLACED
  H->>F: InitializeAsync(placement)
  F->>DB: HEADHUNT_COD: ServiceFee PENDING, Warranty ACTIVE, Commission IN_WARRANTY
